{
  "headline": "FDA's shortage list shows nitroglycerin ointment from AbbVie Inc. posted as To Be Discontinued on 2026-04-14 and the shortage has been listed for 37 months as of 2026-10-21",
  "headline_cites": ["E11", "D7"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's shortage list records nitroglycerin ointment from AbbVie Inc. with a status of To Be Discontinued and an initial posting date of 2026-04-14.",
      "cites": ["E11"]
    },
    {
      "text": "As of 2026-10-21 the shortage has been on FDA's list for 37 months.",
      "cites": ["D7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The label for NDC 50090326600 names A-S Medication Solutions as the product labeler and plant with FEI 1450743, operations RELABEL and REPACK, and a last inspection classification of VAI on 2026-08-12.",
      "cites": ["E10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection records for FEI 1450743 show multiple VAI classifications from 2009 through 2026, with the most recent inspection ending 2026-08-12 and known date 2026-10-14.",
      "cites": ["E4", "E5", "E6", "E7", "E8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A Warning Letter was issued to A-S Medication Solutions LLC on 2017-06-05.",
      "cites": ["E9"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Current inventory at Corvale East is 74 units at 13.2 units per day (6 days on hand), Corvale General holds 198 units at 14.2 units per day (14 days on hand), and Corvale Lakeside holds 24 units at 3.8 units per day (6 days on hand).",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2", "D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-based best option is to buy from Advagen Pharma Ltd., which is not on FDA's shortage list today, though its label names no plant we could place.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    }
  ]
}
